        <p class="subtitle" style="font-size: 22px;">Robustness and reliability up to 20 g</p>

        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 40px;">
            <div style="width: 50%;">
                <p>A modern ship's operational ability is fully de-pendent on its onboard electrical infrastructure.</p>
                <p>Over the years, the growth in the number of electrically powered subsystems on a typical naval vessel has made this infrastructure ever more complex and extensive, and has led to a steady increase in power requirements.</p>
                <p>For over 50 years, ABB SACE has been building shockproof equipment for navies around the world. The considerable installed base of the</p>
            </div>
